<!-- This page describes a numerical research candidate, not validated hardware. -->
= Human-powered DADA cooling-cell candidate =

This configuration is an exploratory first-level simulation of a DADA
refrigerating machine intended to freeze 1 kg of water initially at 20 °C. It
reaches the ideal 20-minute thermal-load target while remaining below the
nominal 150 W human mechanical-power limit. It is '''not''' a tested prototype,
a manufacturing drawing or a physically validated product.

